{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564500/extras/552b3b6250ea75747e10c18214874cbe.avif?t=1749749047\" data-has-big width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lambda Fortress</strong> is a mod for <i>Team Fortress 2</i> that brings the mercenaries to the gritty world of <i>Half-Life 2</i> and other <i>Source</i> Engine Campaigns! Play solo or cooperatively across iconic worlds with a unique twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through City 17, have a lunch break on the coast, or race to White Forest all with your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer and Multiplayer Co-Op Play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for many Source Engine campaigns and map packs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Team Fortress 2 Inventories, bring your TF2 items into Lambda Fortress!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Weapons!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop add-ons!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional weapons, game modes and campaign support over future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>All this and more, now on Steam!</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564500/extras/01dbaf8931a0b41ff4fc5e0980babc8d.avif?t=1749749047\" data-has-big width=800 height=238 /></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564500?t=1749749047","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564500/c36f5dae07a4bc5082fb5728