rt for many Source Engine campaigns and map packs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Team Fortress 2 Inventories, bring your TF2 items into Lambda Fortress!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Weapons!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop add-ons!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional weapons, game modes and campaign support over future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>All this and more, now on Steam!</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564500/extras/01dbaf8931a0b41ff4fc5e0980babc8d.avif?t=1749749047\" data-has-big width=800 height=238 /></span></h2>","developers":["CoaXioN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564500/53e73ca5cee32a595170408c90c84d4fcb11d869/header.jpg?t=1749749047","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 hardware CPU threads - Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5 750 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> You must have Team Fortress 2 and Half-Life 2 installed.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3564500/211841421/e2b4819508756206ad1b0bd1d20868f